# "Attacking Ninjas you control have deathtouch" (CR 702.2, 506.4): on turn 3 Bot1 attacks with Dark Leo & Shredder (1/3, a Ninja) and Ornithopter (no Ninja). Bot2's Grizzly Bears blocks Dark Leo
# and dies to 1 damage, deathtouch; Dark Leo survives its 2. Ornithopter has no deathtouch, and Prehistoric Pet, a Ninja that stays home, has none either; Dark Leo has none outside combat.

